---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NewsletterCTA from '../components/NewsletterCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About TechPulse & Editorial Team"
  description="Learn about the engineering standards, testing methodologies, and editorial team behind TechPulse."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-sky-100">
        Our Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3 mb-4">
        Engineering-First Tech Analysis
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        TechPulse was founded to cut through marketing fluff and deliver reproducible, data-driven software evaluations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Principles (E-E-A-T) -->
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        Founded by <strong>Dhanendiran M</strong>, an AI Engineer and Full-Stack Systems Developer, TechPulse is an independent publication dedicated to autonomous software engineering, cloud architectures, and developer tooling.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Testing Methodology</h2>
      <p>
        Unlike content farms that rephrase vendor marketing copy, our evaluations adhere to strict technical standards:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hands-on Benchmarking:</strong> Every software, framework, and AI tool reviewed is deployed in real-world scenarios across production environments.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Paid Editorial Bias:</strong> We never accept payment to give a positive review. If a tool has bugs, slow latency, or opaque pricing, we document it explicitly.</li>
        <li><strong>Editorial Independence:</strong> While we participate in affiliate partnerships to fund our infrastructure and testing labs, affiliate relationships never dictate our rankings or conclusions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>E-E-A-T Compliance & Integrity</h2>
      <p>
        Google's Search Quality Evaluator Guidelines emphasize Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness (E-E-A-T). We uphold these principles by:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Attributing every article to a verified technical contributor.</li>
        <li>Providing raw benchmark scripts and reproducible code snippets.</li>
        <li>Maintaining open contact channels for corrections and community audits.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
      <p>
        Have a technical inquiry, want to propose a benchmark, or need to report an erratum? Reach out through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or email us at <code>editorial@techpulse.dev</code>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <NewsletterCTA />
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
